@startuml 法线变换原理
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

package "局部空间 (Local Space)" {
  component [顶点 P\n法线 N] as LocalVertex
  note bottom of LocalVertex
    法线垂直于表面
  end note
}

package "世界空间 (World Space)" {
  component [顶点 P'\n法线 N'] as WorldVertex
}

LocalVertex -right-> WorldVertex : 变换

note on link
  **错误做法：**
  P' = P × World
  N' = N × World  ❌
  
  **正确做法：**
  P' = P × World  ✓
  N' = N × WorldInvTranspose  ✓
end note

rectangle "为什么需要逆转置矩阵？" as Why #WhiteSmoke {
  rectangle "问题：非均匀缩放" as Problem #LightYellow
  rectangle "假设沿X轴缩放2倍，Y轴缩放1倍\n如果直接用World矩阵变换法线\n法线将不再垂直于表面" as Issue
  rectangle "解决方案：逆转置矩阵" as Solution #LightGreen
  rectangle "数学证明：\n设切线向量 T，法线向量 N\n满足 T · N = 0 (垂直)\n\n变换后：\nT' = T × M\nN' = N × (M⁻¹)ᵀ\n\n验证垂直性：\nT' · N' = (T × M) · (N × (M⁻¹)ᵀ)\n        = T · (M × (M⁻¹)ᵀ) · N\n        = T · I · N = T · N = 0  ✓" as Proof
  
  Problem --> Issue
  Issue --> Solution
  Solution --> Proof
}

note right of Why
  **WorldInvTranspose = (World⁻¹)ᵀ**
  
  步骤：
  1. 对World矩阵求逆 → World⁻¹
  2. 对逆矩阵转置 → (World⁻¹)ᵀ
  
  特殊情况：
  - 如果只有旋转和平移 → World = WorldInvTranspose
  - 如果有非均匀缩放 → 必须使用逆转置
end note

@enduml
